    title: 
    body: Oh yeah, you will notice it later, but sometimes plants die due to poor
      health conditions, or weather-related conditions.
  - speaker: 0
    customName: 
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 03efae62146028145b5c57653a188b3b, type: 3}
    portraitAnimatorOverride: {fileID: 0}
    title: 
    body: It's unfortunate, but make sure you take any such event as a learning experience...
  - speaker: 0
    customName: 
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3cb2b81b9d777bf4a8dd90f777df3918, type: 3}
    portraitAnimatorOverride: {fileID: 0}
    title: 
    body: ...just in case you don't notice it, I'll send out pings to any plants
      that die, right on top of the tile they were on!
